│ Okay, let’s address this issue. The core     │
│ problem is Django’s OneToOneField            │
│ configuration with parent_link=True.         │
│ Django’s documentation indicates that        │
│ parent_link=True requires the on_delete      │
│ argument to be models.CASCADE or             │
│ models.PROTECT when used with a              │
│ OneToOneField referencing a model that is    │
│ itself a ForeignKey to the parent model.     │
